   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>For question 10, Maria has found a curve of best fit using the equation below.</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"y = -0.46x^{2} + 14x + 17\">y = -0.46x^{2} + 14x + 17</span></p>\n<br><ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"10\">\n  <li>Maria is asked to predict the <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-value on her curve when <span data-math=\"x = 10\">x = 10</span>. To do this, she graphs the function <span data-math=\"x = 10\">x = 10</span> and analyzes the intersection point of the curve and the line.<br><br>What is the <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-value Maria is asked to predict?</li>\n</ol>",
